<!-- **The one place strings live outside i18n/*.json**, and only because Android reads
     them without the app running: the widget picker's labels, and everything the widgets
     draw before (or instead of) memo text. They follow the *system* language, not the
     app's language setting, for the same reason.

     Everything else the widgets show is memo content and comes from the snapshot the app
     publishes, which is already in the app's language. Korean is in values-ko/. -->
